          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Very worried about relapse or brain cancer; repeatedly requested more tests, including a scan and lumbar puncture. Worried that phone use and fluorescent lights at work increase brain pressure and that tap water that smells funny might worsen the infection."
